        <key>sourceChoice</key>
        <string>Native Screen bodies have the required genuine case and small-cap construction. The existing inherited Lato 2.015 parent supplies only its purpose-coded fixed letter ornament or head, separately for each genuine weight/italic. No additional font parent or Noto outline is adopted. Only units-per-em normalisation and placement are applied to the fixed component; its internal contours are unchanged.</string>
        <key>unicodeIdentity</key>
        <string>The fixed ornament/head is part of this encoded historical letter. It is not optional U+0483, not an OpenType combining-mark substitute, and no Unicode decomposition is added.</string>
